    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s gehaten sum m\u00e6re Godes \u00feegn, se folgode Symone \u00feam sceandlican dry, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t se \u00dea forlet Marcellus \u00feone manfullan dry, and folgode Petre and to fulluhte beah. Nu awrat \u00fe\u00e6s Marcellus hu sancte Petres dohtor Petronella gewat of worulde to Criste. Petrus h\u00e6fde wif \u00e6r\u00f0an \u00fee he w\u00e6re gecyrred to Cristes hirede, ac he wi\u00fecw\u00e6\u00f0 si\u00f0\u00f0an woruldlicum Ecce nos reliquimus omnia, et secuti sumus te; quid ergo erit nobis; Efne we forleton ealle \u00feincg on On anginne middaneardes cw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00e6lmihtiga God, Beo\u00f0 gemenigfylde and gefylla\u00f0 \u00feas eor\u00f0an. And Crist wolde on his tocyme cl\u00e6nnysse ar\u00e6ran, and his halgan hired heold on cl\u00e6nnysse. Menn h\u00e6fdon on frym\u00f0e heora magan to wife, and swa wel mosten for \u00f0\u00e6re wifleaste, and gif nu hwa Under moyses \u00e6, moste se bisceop habban an gen\u00e6wnod wif, for \u00fe\u00e6re gewissan \u00e6ftergencgnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t Hit mihte \u00fea wel swa, for \u00fean \u00fee hi ne m\u00e6ssodon n\u00e6fre, ac hi offrodon nytenu on heora lacum Gode. Ne husel n\u00e6s gehalgod \u00e6r\u00feam \u00f0e se h\u00e6lend com, and \u00fea niwan gecy\u00f0nysse mid Cristendome ar\u00e6rde, And bisceopas ne beo\u00f0 nu be gebyrdum gecorene, ac seo halige gela\u00f0ung lufa\u00f0 \u00fea cl\u00e6nan, and Crist We sceoldan secgan be \u00fe\u00e6re snoteran Petronellan, \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan Petres dehter, ac us bearn \u00feis on mod. Se fores",
